OL,4,CMcDonald's sex abuse: 'They were       
OL,5,Cwaiting for the younger girls to turn  
OL,6,C18'                                    
OL,7,GA former McDonald's worker who says a  
OL,8,Gmanager failed to protect her when she 
OL,9,Gwas being sexualised by customers, has 
OL,10,Gcalled on the firm to "change the way  
OL,11,Gthey treat younger employees".         
OL,13,FHope, who worked at a branch in the    
OL,14,FWest Midlands in 2023, also told BBC   
OL,15,FNews she saw older colleagues eyeing   
OL,16,Fup 16- and 17-year-old workers, and    
OL,17,Ftalking about wanting to sleep with    
OL,18,Fthem when they turned 18.              
